For 5-star summons, there's a <color=#B65223>50%</color> chance to get the rate-up character, <color=#B65223>[upname=2]</color>.

{Special Rules}
In the [▩1%s] banner, if you have not obtained any 6-star character after <color=#B65223>60</color> consecutive summons, the rate of summoning a 6-star character in the next summon will increase from 1.5% to <color=#B65223>4%</color>. If you still have not obtained any 6-star characters, then every next summon that doesn't grant a 6-star character will increase the rate by <color=#B65223>2.5%</color>.
Every <color=#B65223>70</color> summons guarantee a 6-star character.

This banner is a [Time-Limited Character Banner]. It shares the 6-star character guarantee count with other similar banners, and the guarantee count will not be cleared after the banner expires. Both the count and the rate bonus it brings will carry over to the next [Time-Limited Character Banner].
P. S. After you have obtained a 6-star character, the rate of summoning 6-star characters in [Time-Limited Character Banner] events will be reset to <color=#B65223>1.5%</color>.

{Duplicate Characters}

Regardless of source, including but not limited to banners, Bank, and system gifts:
▪ When you obtain the same 6-star character for the 2nd-6th time, the duplicate character will be converted into <color=#B65223>1</color> Artifice of the character and <color=#B65223>12</color> Albums of the Lost every time; starting from the 7th time, the duplicate character will be converted into <color=#B65223>28</color> Albums of the Lost and <color=#B65223>10</color> Pneuma Film Developers every time.

